{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"santizhu064-e-sr-jun-chengxiang-election","title":"《吴录》群臣推峻为太尉胤为司徒、媚峻者表峻为丞相不置御史大夫","accounts":[{"id":"santizhu064-a-5435241e2336cf5bd1b2","label":"裴注·吴录","text":"群臣上奏共推峻为太尉、议胤为司徒；时有媚峻者以为大统宜在公族、胤为亚公声名素重不可贰，乃表以峻为丞相，又不置御史大夫；士人皆失望","evidence":["santizhu064-q-8db31efd03aa1d3fede1"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0075","role":"被推为太尉、被表为丞相（不置御史大夫）","evidence":["santizhu064-q-8db31efd03aa1d3fede1"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0005","role":"被议为司徒","evidence":["santizhu064-q-8db31efd03aa1d3fede1"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"未由相邻段落推算纪年；原文时间表达保留在来源引句中。","evidence":["santizhu064-q-8db31efd03aa1d3fede1"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu064-q-8db31efd03aa1d3fede1","source_order":[64,414,0],"order":11001}],"persons":[{"id":"santizhu-p0005","name":"滕胤","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0075","name":"孙峻","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"santizhu064-q-8db31efd03aa1d3fede1","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-1ceb036508e1f6a746e3","layer":"pei","quote":"《吴录》曰：“群臣上奏，共推峻为太尉，议胤为司徒。时有媚峻者，以为大统宜在公族；若滕胤为亚公，声名素重，众心所附，不可贰也。乃表以峻为丞相，又不置御史大夫。士人皆失望矣。”","attribution":"裴注·吴录","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":413,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0717b2f99a684dd2a98d","start":3,"end":89,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
